        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FRP175, Solid Brass Flush Ring Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFlush Ring Pulls are especially designed for cabinets or doors when you want a flush (non protruding) handle pull. The Small Flush Ring Pull's solid brass construction is durable, allowing for years of continuous use and is resistant to corrosion. It measures 1-3/4\" high and 1-1/2\" wide. Comes packaged with matching finish screws for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FRP175-Specifications.gif?v=1704354571\" width=\"318\" height=\"195\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana FRP175 Ring Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/large-flush-ring-pull-deltana-frp25\"><b>Larger Flush Ring Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana FRP175 Small Flush Ring Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Max Depth: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Cutout Max Depth:  3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cutout Diameter: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FRP175.pdf?v=1704262161\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana FRP175  Dimensions  Diagram (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Small Flush Ring Pull | Deltana FRP175",
                "description": "Solid Brass Flush Ring Pull Deltana FRP175 - Flush Ring Pulls are especially designed for cabinets or doors when you want a flush (non protruding) handle pull. The Small Flush Ring Pull's solid brass construction is durable, allowing for years of continuous use and is resistant to corrosion. It measures 1-3/4 inches high and 1-1/2 inches wide. Comes packaged with matching finish screws for easy installation. Available in 9 great finishes.",
                "keywords": "del-FRP175 Small Flush Ring Pulls, del-FRP175u3, Deltana FRP175 flush ring pulls, deltana solid brass door flush pulls, pocket doors, handle for sliding doors, pocket door handles, cabinet pulls, square ring pulls, pocket door hardware, DEL-FRP175U3.DEL-FRP175U5, DEL-FRP175U10B, DEL-FRP175U15, DEL-FRP175U15A, DEL-FRP175U19, DEL-FRP175U26, DEL-FRP175U26D, DEL-FRP175CR003,"
